  "description": "The package to install: a dependency-injection first, domain-driven PDF library for .NET 10 and .NET 11 that merges whole documents or selected pages with every PDF byte read and written in-house. Brings SharpCorePDF.Domain, .Application, .Infrastructure and .DependencyInjection in one step; AddSharpCorePDF() is the wiring.",
